- patches/custom_all_reduce.357d07bcb.diff and patches/custom_all_reduce.c4f6245f8.diff are diffs
  against vllm/distributed/device_communicators/custom_all_reduce.py of 1Cat-vLLM at those commits
  (SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project) and contain its context lines.
- car_patch.py contains short excerpts of that file (its anchors) and writes a modified copy of it.

The SM70 push all-reduce kernel this project enables is 1Cat-vLLM's (csrc/custom_all_reduce.cuh), which
its source credits as adapted from the one-shot push collective of SGLang-V100
(https://github.com/haohervchb/sglang-V100). No kernel source is included here.
